      </j:conditional>
      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>The Land of Israel Haggadah was contributed by Rabbi Seth (Avi) Kaddish from the text as it appears in Hebrew Wikisource, along with his English translation.</tei:p>
